      <section class="alerts-page">
  <div class="alerts-header">
    <span class="alerts-badge">Community Health Alerts</span>
    <h2>Stay up to date with the latest public health notices and facility updates.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="alerts-list">
    
    <div class="alert-card border-bright-blue">
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="tag tag-urgent">URGENT NOTICE</span>
        <h3>Lassa Fever Precaution & Sanitation Drive</h3>
        <p>Following recent regional advisories, residents are urged to maintain high hygiene standards. Free rodent-proofing education and sanitation kits are available at the outpatient wing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-action bg-urgent">
        <span class="location">Agbor-obi primary health centre</span>
        <span class="datetime">May 22, 2026 • 09:00AM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert-card border-orange">
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="tag tag-immunization">IMMUNIZATION</span>
        <h3>Childhood Polio & Yellow Fever Vaccines</h3>
        <p>Protect your children. Free routine immunizations for children under 5 will be administered all week. Please ensure you bring your child's physical or digital health record.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-action bg-immunization">
        <span class="location">Agbor-obi primary health centre</span>
        <span class="datetime">May 25, 2026 • 08:00AM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert-card border-dark-blue">
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="tag tag-general">FACILITY UPDATE</span>
        <h3>Maternity Ward Routine Maintenance</h3>
        <p>The main maternity wing will undergo scheduled power system upgrades. All scheduled antenatal consultations for this week have been temporarily relocated to Wing B.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-action bg-general">
        <span class="location">Central hospital Agbor</span>
        <span class="datetime">May 26, 2026 • 12:00PM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert-card border-bright-blue">
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="tag tag-urgent">URGENT NOTICE</span>
        <h3>Malaria Prevention Drive & Free Testing</h3>
        <p>With the onset of the rainy season, free rapid malaria testing and insecticide-treated nets will be available. Supplies are distributed on a first-come, first-serve basis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-action bg-urgent">
        <span class="location">Owa-alero Government Hospital</span>
        <span class="datetime">May 28, 2026 • 08:15AM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert-card border-dark-blue">
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="tag tag-general">SYSTEM UPDATE</span>
        <h3>DHMP Digital Booking System Live</h3>
        <p>Patients can now book all non-emergency appointments online via this platform to bypass waiting rooms. Walk-ins will be strictly attended to after scheduled patients.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-action bg-general">
        <span class="location">All Facilities</span>
        <span class="datetime">May 29, 2026 • 06:00AM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>




























